This project vendors and adapts data-layer code and bundled game-data files from
alfizari/Elden-Ring-Nightreign-Save-Editor (https://github.com/alfizari/Elden-Ring-Nightreign-Save-Editor),
licensed under the MIT License below. Adapted source files retain a header
comment crediting the source; this notice is the canonical copy of that
license text as required by its terms.

Affected files:
  src/nightreign_relics/save/bnd4.py
  src/nightreign_relics/save/locator.py
  src/nightreign_relics/save/inventory.py
  src/nightreign_relics/catalog/loader.py
  src/nightreign_relics/catalog/names.py
  src/nightreign_relics/illegal.py
  resources/Param/*.csv
  resources/Text/**/*.fmg.xml

See docs/adr/0001-vendor-extracted-modules-from-reference-editor.md for why
these were extracted/adapted rather than used as a submodule or rewritten
